OL,3,GNEWSADorset MPs welcome Budget
OL,4,Adevolution commitment
OL,5,
OL,6,FDorset MPs have welcomed an
OL,7,Fannouncement that the government is in
OL,8,Fthe "final stages" of agreeing
OL,9,Fdevolution deals.
OL,11,FEdward Morello previously asked for a
OL,12,Fguarantee that the Wessex region would
OL,13,Fhave a mayor by the 2028 election,
OL,14,Fwhich was backed by the prime minister.
OL,16,FIn the detail of the Budget, delivered
OL,17,Fby Chancellor John Healey, the
OL,18,Fgovernment has confirmed Wessex is one
OL,19,Fof the 10 local authorities due
OL,20,Fdevolution agreements.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,334,330,200,160,0,100
